<% layout("/layouts/boilerplate") %>

<div class="container mt-4 mb-5" style="max-width: 780px;">
  <h2 class="fw-bold mb-4 text-royal">Privacy Policy</h2>
  <p class="text-secondary small mb-4">Last updated: August 2026</p>

  <div class="mb-4">
    <h5 class="fw-bold">1. Information We Collect</h5>
    <p class="text-secondary">We collect your name, email address, and booking details when you create an account or make a reservation. We verify your email via a verification link to prevent duplicate or fraudulent accounts.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-4">
    <h5 class="fw-bold">2. How We Use Your Information</h5>
    <p class="text-secondary">Your information is used to process bookings, verify your identity, prevent one person from creating multiple accounts, communicate booking updates, and improve our services (including AI-powered features like search and travel assistance).</p>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-4">
    <h5 class="fw-bold">3. Payment Information</h5>
    <p class="text-secondary">Payments are processed by our third-party payment partner. Fairstay does not store your full card details on its own servers.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-4">
    <h5 class="fw-bold">4. Data Sharing</h5>
    <p class="text-secondary">We do not sell your personal data. Limited information is shared with hosts (for confirmed bookings) and service providers (payment processing, SMS/email verification) strictly to operate the platform.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-4">
    <h5 class="fw-bold">5. Your Rights</h5>
    <p class="text-secondary">You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal data at any time by contacting support.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="mb-4">
    <h5 class="fw-bold">6. Contact</h5>
    <p class="text-secondary">For privacy-related questions, please reach out through our support channels.</p>
  </div>
</div>
